#!/usr/bin/env python3
# run-tests - hardware test runner for Ultimate devices.
#
# Runs the E2E gate by default, and can additionally or instead run the perf
# benchmarks and the soak tests. Every suite drives the real firmware over
# REST/FTP/Telnet, so a device has to be reachable and idle. Suites run
# sequentially; the exit status is non-zero if any of them fails.
#
# One target runs here. Several targets run as several of these, one child
# process each, scheduled so that no two of them hold the same physical
# machine at once. Nothing below run_targets knows about more than one device.
#
# Reports through tests/lib/report.py, the same module every suite calls, so
# harness lines and suite lines follow one set of rules.

